   },
   {
    "t": "v3.0.7",
    "d": "2025-04-13",
    "n": "* Commit 094bcb4 for Cloudberry: Added support for recognizing 'Apache Cloudberry' in the version() command, facilitating users in working with Cloudberry from the trunk branch.\n* add unit test to /wal-g/internal/databases/greenplum/backup_push_hand… by @hairy-snake in https://github.com/wal-g/wal-g/pull/1890\n* storages (s3): Add AWS_DUAL_STACK configuration by @sundbry in https://github.com/wal-g/wal-g/pull/1691\n* add user to Redis connection by @kronwerk in https://github.com/wal-g/wal-g/pull/1894\n* Add"
