    "n": "* Preserve predecessor checkpoint table-ID indexes in new backup archives, with checksum verification, so restored databases retain the history needed by snapshot/PITR retention and subsequent checkpoints.\nTargeted package tests, race tests, repeated restore checks, and an independent fresh-WAL restore test passed on the reviewed PR head. The release commit has the identical source tree. GitHub MongoDB E2E passed, but no complete kernel-regression run was recorded on the final merge SHA. This release procee"
   },
