    "d": "2026-10-29",
    "n": "Release date: October 29, 2026  \nMatrixOne version: v4.2.1-hotfix-20261029\n\nThis hotfix is based directly on `v4.2.1-hotfix-20261026` (`47e644f2d704c02baf90461de8f164e1d39c344e`), adding exactly three commits from `release/v4.2.1-hotfix-20261026`. Release commit: `3391c6844e95d1bb27a647b18f48f7c3a5ba1695`. The prior materialized CTE and subscription secondary-index fixes are retained.\n\n## Key Improvements\n\n### Query planning and window aggregation\n\n* Skip redundant child traversals when predicate deduction "
   }
